  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1101.02 Applicability; Potential Conflicts",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1101.02 Applicability; Potential Conflicts.\n\n(a) This chapter shall apply to all public bathing places as defined in Env-Wq 1102.\n\n(b) If any requirement in Env-Wq 1100 or in any document or standard incorporated by reference conflicts with any other applicable requirement or local ordinance, the requirement that is most protective of public health shall apply.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100) #8468, eff 11-1-05; ss by #10577, eff 5-1-14 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100); ss by #13198, eff 5-1-21 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1100)",
